talos:machine/machine:Machine.description:
Manages a Talos node: applies machine configuration and keeps the Talos OS version in sync.

On every `terraform refresh`, the provider reads the running Talos version and the active machine configuration hash from the node. If either differs from what Terraform last wrote, the next `pulumi up` will reconcile the drift — re-applying configuration or upgrading the OS as needed.

